{#
  Northwind Trading — Quarterly report template (tenant-maintained)
  Revision: 2026-Q2 · owner: Northwind Trading, Finance Reporting

  Variables this template expects (supplied by the render context):
    - tenant       — tenant/company name shown in the report heading
    - period       — reporting-period label (e.g. "Q2 2026")
    - rows         — list of line items; each row provides:
        - label    — metric name
        - value    — formatted metric value
    - prepared_by  — name shown in the closing line

  Output format: an HTML fragment — an <h1> heading, a period paragraph, a table
  with one row per line item (label, value), and a closing "Prepared by" paragraph.
#}
<h1>Quarterly report for {{ tenant }}</h1>
<p>Period: {{ period }}</p>
<table>
{% for row in rows %}  <tr><td>{{ row.label }}</td><td>{{ row.value }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}</table>
<p>Prepared by {{ prepared_by }}.</p>
